### PetClinic API — ejemplos ejecutables
### Requiere la aplicación en http://localhost:8080
### Compatible con REST Client (VS Code) o IntelliJ HTTP Client

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Salud
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### OpenAPI
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### Listar propietarios por prefijo de apellido
GET {{base}}/owners?lastName=Dav&page=1&size=5

### Listar todos (página 1)
GET {{base}}/owners?lastName=&page=1&size=5

### Página fuera de rango: debe devolver la página 1
GET {{base}}/owners?lastName=Dav&page=99&size=5

### Obtener propietario con mascotas
GET {{base}}/owners/1

### Propietario inexistente -> 404 ProblemDetail
GET {{base}}/owners/9999

### Crear propietario -> 201
POST {{base}}/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Garcia",
  "address": "Calle 1",
  "city": "Madrid",
  "telephone": "6001112222"
}

### Propietario inválido (teléfono) -> 400 con errors[]
POST {{base}}/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Garcia",
  "address": "Calle 1",
  "city": "Madrid",
  "telephone": "123"
}

### Actualizar propietario
PUT {{base}}/owners/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "George",
  "lastName": "Franklin",
  "address": "110 W. Liberty St.",
  "city": "Madison",
  "telephone": "6085551023"
}

### Catálogo de tipos de mascota
GET {{base}}/pet-types

### Añadir mascota -> 201
POST {{base}}/owners/1/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nina",
  "birthDate": "2020-01-01",
  "typeId": 1
}

### Mascota duplicada para el mismo propietario -> 409
POST {{base}}/owners/1/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "leo",
  "birthDate": "2020-01-01",
  "typeId": 1
}

### Actualizar mascota
PUT {{base}}/owners/1/pets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leo",
  "birthDate": "2010-09-07",
  "typeId": 1
}

### Listar visitas de una mascota
GET {{base}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits

### Registrar visita sin fecha: se usa mañana -> 201
POST {{base}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "revisión"
}

### Visita con fecha pasada -> 400
POST {{base}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "revisión",
  "date": "2020-01-01"
}

### Visita para mascota de otro propietario -> 404
GET {{base}}/owners/1/pets/7/visits

### Listar veterinarios
GET {{base}}/vets

### Obtener veterinario
GET {{base}}/vets/3

### Veterinario inexistente -> 404
GET {{base}}/vets/9999
